  <div class="page-content">
    <h1>About Wailea Art</h1>
    <p class="lede">Wailea Art is a small print studio making original art available for everyday walls.</p>
    <p>Each piece starts as an original work and is reproduced as a museum-quality print, sized 8.5&Prime; &times; 11&Prime; so it's easy to frame and easy to send. Prints are available individually, or in bulk for shops, events, and gifting.</p>
    <p>Every retail order and packaged bulk order ships with a protective plastic sleeve, a support backing board, and a white card envelope, so your print arrives ready to frame.</p>
    <p>Have a question about a piece, a custom order, or wholesale pricing? Get in touch on the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</main>

